                                    <li>🌄 Sandhya Twilight (05:00 PM – 07:00 PM)</li>
                                    <li>🌙 Pradosh Kaal (07:00 PM – 09:00 PM)</li>
                                </ul>
                            </li>
                        </ol>
                        <a href="/Service/Index" class="btn-stitch-primary py-1 px-3 small d-inline-block text-decoration-none">Choose Service &amp; Book Date →</a>`;
                }
                else if (lower.includes("payment") || lower.includes("cash") || lower.includes("cod") || lower.includes("dakshina") || lower.includes("upi") || lower.includes("card") || lower.includes("pay")) {
                    answer = `
                        <p class="mb-1"><strong>🪔 Sacred Dakshina Payment Methods:</strong></p>
                        <p class="mb-1" style="font-size: 12px;">A Vedic ceremony is a sacred spiritual service, not an e-commerce parcel! We offer dignified options:</p>
                        <ul class="mb-2 ps-3" style="font-size: 12px;">
                            <li><strong>Pay Dakshina After Puja (In-Person):</strong> Offer the holy Dakshina respectfully to the Pandit ji in cash or direct UPI once the vidhi and havan conclude satisfactorily.</li>
                            <li><strong>Instant UPI with Dynamic QR:</strong> Scan &amp; pay via Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm, or BHIM.</li>
                            <li><strong>Debit / Credit Card:</strong> Secure 256-bit encrypted online card payment.</li>
                        </ul>`;
                }
                else if (lower.includes("puja") || lower.includes("service") || lower.includes("homa") || lower.includes("havan") || lower.includes("katha") || lower.includes("list")) {
                    answer = `
                        <p class="mb-1"><strong>🪔 Our 12 Authentic Vedic Services:</strong></p>
                        <div class="row g-1 mb-2" style="font-size: 11px;">
