                            <div class="col-6">📖 Satyanarayan Katha (₹2,500)</div>
                            <div class="col-6">🏠 Griha Pravesh (₹3,500)</div>
                            <div class="col-6">🔮 Navgraha Shanti (₹3,000)</div>
                            <div class="col-6">🔱 Maha Mrityunjaya (₹4,500)</div>
                            <div class="col-6">💰 Lakshmi Kuber (₹3,800)</div>
                            <div class="col-6">🌿 Rudrabhishek (₹2,100)</div>
                            <div class="col-6">💍 Vivah Sanskar (₹11,000)</div>
                            <div class="col-6">👶 Namkaran (₹2,100)</div>
                            <div class="col-6">📚 Saraswati Puja (₹1,800)</div>
                            <div class="col-6">🐍 Kaal Sarp Dosh (₹5,100)</div>
